\operatorname{SV}(X,d)
=
X-\text{dimension }d
}

Then observe what rushes in to fill the vacuum.

Your punctuation experiment was already one:

\text{sentence}-\text{punctuation}
\rightarrow
\text{reader supplies segmentation}.

“The lions mane” removed referential specificity:

